IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc2-incapacity`
IMPORT `ssc2-widow-ib`

-- Tests for ssc2-widow-ib.l4 (ss 40, 41, 42). Every expected value is written by hand from the text.
-- Money figures are INVENTED test inputs: the rates come from Schedule 4 and s 39 and are not in this part.
-- Calendar arithmetic used by hand: 2024 is a leap year, 2025, 2023 and 2022 are not.

§ `Tests -- fixtures`

GIVEN pa IS A DATE
GIVETH A Person
`s 40 test person attaining pensionable age on` MEANS Person WITH
    `date of birth` IS Date 1 1 1960
    `sex` IS Woman
    `marital status` IS `widowed or a surviving civil partner`
    `date of attaining pensionable age` IS pa

GIVEN a IS A DATE, b IS A DATE
GIVETH A Period
`s 42 test period from` MEANS Period WITH `the first day` IS a, `the last day` IS b

§ `Tests -- the Kleene helpers`

#ASSERT `s 40 not` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 40 not` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 40 not` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 40 both` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 40 both` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 40 both` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 40 both` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 40 either` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 40 either` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 40 either` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 40 either` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

