-- (5) arguments: entitled to a widow's pension, entitled with a reduction under s 39(4), the long-term rate, the weekly rate of the widow's pension (200 and the pension figures are invented)
#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` FALSE FALSE (JUST 200) NOTHING EQUALS JUST 200
#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` TRUE TRUE (JUST 200) (JUST 150) EQUALS JUST 50
-- "the difference" is the amount by which they differ, whichever is larger (fork F19)
#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` TRUE TRUE (JUST 200) (JUST 250) EQUALS JUST 50
#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` TRUE TRUE (JUST 200) (JUST 200) EQUALS JUST 0
