#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- entitled to a widow's pension without a reduction: neither (a) nor (b) speaks
#ASSERT `s 40(5) the weekly rate of incapacity benefit payable under this section` TRUE FALSE (JUST 200) (JUST 150) EQUALS NOTHING
